<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
  <title>Privacy Policy — VillasGame.com</title>
  <style>
    /* ---------- INLINE HEADER / FOOTER STYLES (consistent with other pages) ---------- */
    body { margin:0; font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial; color:#111; background:#fff; line-height:1.5; font-size: x-small;}
    .navbar { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:20px; padding:14px 20px; background:#121212; color:#fff; }
    .logo { font-weight:700; font-size:18px; }
    .nav-links { display:flex; gap:12px; margin-left:10px; }
    .nav-links a { color:#ddd; text-decoration:none; font-size:14px; }
    .search-bar { margin-left:auto; }
    .search-bar input { padding:8px 10px; border-radius:6px; border:1px solid #333; background:#111; color:#fff; width:220px; }
    .auth-links { margin-left:12px; display:flex; gap:8px; }
    .auth-links a { color:#fff; text-decoration:none; padding:8px 10px; border-radius:6px; font-size:14px; background:transparent; border:1px solid #333; }
    .auth-links .signup { background:#ff6a00; color:#fff; border-color:transparent; }

    .container { max-width:1000px; margin:36px auto; padding:0 18px; }
    h1 { margin:0 0 12px; font-size:28px; }
    .muted { color:#555; margin-bottom:18px; }

    article { background:#f8f8f8; border-radius:8px; padding:18px; border:1px solid #eee; }
    article h2 { margin-top:18px; }
    article p, article li { color:#333; }

    .footer { background:#0f1720; color:#cbd5e1; padding:28px 16px; margin-top:40px; }
    .footer .footer-inner { max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; text-align:center; }
    .footer .brand { font-weight:700; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:8px; color:#fff; }
    .footer .links { display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin:8px 0; }
    .footer .links a { color:#9aa0a6; text-decoration:none; font-size:14px; }
    .footer .copy { color:#7f8a93; margin-top:10px; font-size:13px; }

    @media (max-width:600px) {
      .search-bar input { width:140px; }
      .nav-links { display:none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Header (inline) -->
  <header class="navbar">
    <div class="logo">🔥 VillasGame</div>
    <nav class="nav-links">
      <a href="/about">About</a>
      <a href="/">Blogs</a> 
      <a href="/contact">Contact</a> 
    </nav>
    <div class="search-bar">
      <input type="text" id="searchInput" placeholder="Search games..." autocomplete="off" />
    </div>
    <div class="auth-links">
      <a href="/login">Login</a>
      <a href="/signup" class="signup">Sign up</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString() %></p>

    <article>
      <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>At VillasGame.com, your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, share, and protect information when you visit and interact with our website. This policy also explains how we use third-party services such as Google AdSense to serve ads.</p>

      <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We may collect the following types of information:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> Information about how you use our site (games played, time spent, pages visited), your IP address, browser type, and device information.</li>
        <li><strong>Cookies and tracking technologies:</strong> We (and our partners) use cookies, web beacons, local storage, and similar technologies to collect and store information about your activity on the site.</li>
        <li><strong>Third-party data:</strong> We work with third-party services such as Google AdSense, which may collect data about your interactions with ads and other content.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Use of Information</h2>
      <p>We use the data we collect to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide, maintain, and improve our website and games.</li>
        <li>Serve personalized or non-personalized ads via Google AdSense.</li>
        <li>Analyze user behavior to improve site experience and product decisions.</li>
        <li>Prevent fraud, abuse, and to protect the security of the platform and our users.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Google AdSense and Advertising</h2>
      <p>VillasGame.com uses Google AdSense to display advertisements. Google, as a third-party vendor, may use cookies to serve ads based on your previous visits to our site or other sites. These cookies can track interactions with ads and how often ads are shown.</p>
      <p>Google may collect device identifiers, location data, and usage information to provide relevant ads. For more information on how Google uses data, please review <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google’s Privacy &amp; Terms</a>.</p>

      <h2>5. User Consent &amp; Opt-Out</h2>
      <p>Depending on your region (for example, within the EU), we may ask for your consent before using cookies or tracking technologies. You can opt out of personalized advertising using Google’s controls:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Visit <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ad Settings</a> to manage ad personalization.</li>
        <li>Control or delete cookies using your browser settings. Note: if you disable cookies, some features of our site may not work as intended.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Sharing of Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We do not sell your personal data.</li>
        <li>We may share aggregated or anonymized data with third parties for analytics and reporting purposes.</li>
        <li>We may share data with Google and other service providers as needed to serve ads and comply with AdSense policies.</li>
        <li>We may disclose information to comply with legal obligations or to protect our rights, property, safety, or other users.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>7. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We implement reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect data from unauthorized access, alteration, or destruction. However, no method of transmission over the internet or method of electronic storage is 100% secure. We cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

      <h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on your location, you may have certain rights, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>The right to know what personal data we hold about you.</li>
        <li>The right to request correction or deletion of your data.</li>
        <li>The right to restrict or object to certain processing activities.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at: <a href="mailto:your-email@example.com">swatikumari@digigrove.com</a></p>

      <h2>9. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>We retain personal data only for as long as necessary to provide the services or as required by law. Aggregated or anonymized data may be retained indefinitely for analytics and reporting.</p>

      <h2>10. Policy Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will post the updated policy on this page with a revised "Last Updated" date. Continued use of the site after updates means you accept the revised policy.</p>

      <h2>11. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>If you have questions or concerns about this policy, contact us at:<br>
        Email: <a href="mailto:your-email@example.com">swatikumari@digigrove.com</a><br>
        Address: Digigrove Digital Private Limited -Plot No. 34, Phase IV, Udyog Vihar, Gurugram, Haryana - 122008, India</p>
    </article>
  </main>

  <!-- Footer (inline) -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div class="brand">🔥 VillasGame</div> 
      <div class="links">
        <a href="/about">About</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
      </div>
      <div class="copy">© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> VillasGame.com. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // quick UX: focus search when "/" pressed
    document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e) {
      var tag = (e.target && e.target.tagName) || '';
      if (e.key === '/' && tag !== 'INPUT' && tag !== 'TEXTAREA') {
        e.preventDefault();
        var el = document.getElementById('searchInput');
        if (el) el.focus();
      }
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
